BT /F1 11 Tf 56 742.0 Td (  and improve optimisation in deep networks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 727.5 Td (- Softmax: converts a vector of logits into a probability distribution; used) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 713.0 Td (  at the output for multi-class classification.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 698.5 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 684.0 Td (4. Loss functions) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 669.5 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 655.0 Td (Mean squared error is natural for regression:) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 640.5 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 626.0 Td (  L = \(1/n\) * sum_i \(y_i - y_hat_i\)^2) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 611.5 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 597.0 Td (Cross-entropy is the standard choice for classification:) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 582.5 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 568.0 Td (  L = -sum_i y_i * log\(y_hat_i\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 553.5 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 539.0 Td (Cross-entropy measures how surprised the model is by the true label. It pairs) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 524.5 Td (with softmax for a numerically stable gradient: the derivative with respect to) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 510.0 Td (the logits is simply \(y_hat - y\), which is why classification networks are so) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 495.5 Td (well behaved.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 481.0 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 466.5 Td (5. Backpropagation) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 452.0 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 437.5 Td (Backpropagation computes the gradient of the loss with respect to every weight) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 423.0 Td (by applying the chain rule backward through the computation graph. For a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 408.5 Td (composition L = f\(g\(h\(x\)\)\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 394.0 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 379.5 Td (  dL/dx = \(dL/df\) * \(df/dg\) * \(dg/dh\) * \(dh/dx\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 365.0 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 350.5 Td (Each layer stores its activations from the forward pass; the backward pass) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 336.0 Td (reuses them to avoid recomputation. The algorithm is exact \(not an) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 321.5 Td (approximation\) and costs roughly the same as two forward passes. Autodiff) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 307.0 Td (frameworks \(PyTorch, JAX\) build the graph for you, but understanding the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 292.5 Td (chain rule is essential for debugging shapes and vanishing gradients.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 278.0 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 263.5 Td (6. Optimisation) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 249.0 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 234.5 Td (Gradient descent updates parameters in the direction that reduces the loss:) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 220.0 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 205.5 Td (  theta <- theta - lr * dL/dtheta) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 191.0 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 176.5 Td (- Stochastic gradient descent \(SGD\) estimates the gradient from a mini-batch.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 162.0 Td (  Mini-batches give noisy but unbiased estimates and make GPU parallelism) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 147.5 Td (  worthwhile.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 133.0 Td (- Momentum accumulates a velocity term, smoothing noisy gradients and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 118.5 Td (  accelerating through ravines.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 104.0 Td (- Adam combines momentum with per-parameter adaptive learning rates and is a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 89.5 Td (  strong default for most tasks.) Tj ET
endstream
